--[[
	╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
	║           VFX Animator  •  Executor Edition  v1.3  (live refresh)    ║
	║  Spawn / animate / parent VFX parts to any body part                 ║
	║  Position sin • Rotation sin • Infinite spin • Scale pulse           ║
	╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

	BUGS FIXED:
	  1. ParticleEmitter has no LightInfluence property — removed
	  2. makeColorRow: unused track frames removed; RGB inputs now work correctly
	  3. makeVec3Row: table reference mutation fixed so el.xxx updates properly
	  4. generateCode() called twice on Export — cached to local
	  5. Sin size animation added to spawner AND code export
	  6. spawnElement: scale pulse reads animSizeAmp/Speed correctly
	  7. Code export: animRot target expression built before use (was referencing
	     variables before they were assigned in some branches)
	  8. Beam/Trail/PE/BB host parts had CanQuery/CanTouch missing
	  9. Body collapse toggle checked wrong button region (whole header clickable
	     including action buttons) — header click guard added
	 10. Duplicate: table copy now does deep copy for nested tables correctly
	 11. ParticleEmitter texture asset IDs, live value refresh, ground spawn,
	     two-function export, and larger click targets added
	 12. Export checks clipboard writers and leaves selectable code when none work
	 13. Export follows resolved player parts and places effects before smoothing
	 14. Fractional particle rates are preserved with optional gapless rate floor
 15. ParticleEmitter now exposes + exports ALL emitter properties (LockedToPart, LightEmission,
     LightInfluence (it DOES exist on ParticleEmitter), Brightness, Drag, Acceleration, ZOffset,
     TimeScale, VelocityInheritance, EmissionDirection, Transparency, Squash, Shape*, Flipbook*)
 16. Curves: Size / Transparency / Squash (NumberSequence) + Color gradient (ColorSequence)
 17. Export emits the do...end scoped, global-function form (no auto Heartbeat connect unless
     exportAutoConnect = true). LockedToPart toggle now applies live.
--]]

